--- !u!114 &549513891303105618
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2635943762075378126}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0a6087f43d5f380428fb318ddb7a8cbf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: {fileID: 5930997735715427208}
  lines:
  - Please, I'm telling you! That palace is all haunted, we need to do something!
  - NOW!!!
  - Oh dear god... you're still thinking about that? That place is abandoned anyway...
  - IT DOESN'T MATTER! What if they ever get out, huh? Those ghosts are dangerous
    you know, one touch and you're out!
  - You think I don't know that? Come on! I haven't been an expert on those for 30
    years for nothing
  - Well, if you're such an expert then go get them with that fancy orb of yours!
  - Never in my 60 years of life... Alright! I'll do anything for you to stop coming
    into my office every single day.
  - Well then you better come in one piece, you listen?
  - 'Yeah.. yeah.. now go to sleep, dammit! '
  nextScene: Game
